      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B228FCE4E0B6B21518D676554E6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0001>月<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0002>日？\n就是今天对吧！？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我这就去做准备，\n请您稍等一下！",
