      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002020100016708001000020201000265E5FF1F000A5C31662F4ECA59295BF95427FF01FF1F00100001BE01000A62118FD95C3153BB505A51C65907FF0C000A8BF760A87A0D7B494E004E0BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0001>月<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0002>日？\n今天是2月28日，而且今年<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要把今天视为生日当天对吧！？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我这就去做准备，\n请您稍等一下！",
